<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-833] EntryLogId and EntryLogLimit should not be larger than Integer.MAX_VALUE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-833</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;currently the index entry position is combined with log id and entry offset inside a log. so it means that log id and entry log file size shouldn&apos;t be larger than Integer.MAX_VALUE. otherwise, it would cause trouble.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12763351">BOOKKEEPER-833</key>
            <summary>EntryLogId and EntryLogLimit should not be larger than Integer.MAX_VALUE</summary>
